sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant Clerk as Clerk / Supabase Auth
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as Database (SQLAlchemy)
    participant Storage as Storage Service

    User->>UI: Open Application
    alt Clerk / Supabase SSO Login
        UI->>Clerk: Authenticate with Google/GitHub/Email
        Clerk-->>UI: Return JWT / Session Token
        UI->>API: POST /api/auth/clerk-sync (Bearer Token)
        API->>API: Verify Clerk JWT Signature & Claims
        API->>DB: Query or Upsert User Record
        API-->>UI: Return DataWise User Session & Permissions
    else Native Email / Password Login
        UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login (email, password)
        API->>DB: Query User & Verify Argon2/Bcrypt Hash
        API-->>UI: Return Access Token (HS256) + User Profile
    end

    Note over UI, API: Authenticated API Requests
    UI->>API: GET /api/projects (Header: Authorization Bearer)
    API->>API: Validate Token & Extract User Context
    API->>DB: Filter Projects (WHERE organization_id / user_id = current)
    DB-->>API: Return User Projects
    API-->>UI: Render User Workspace

    Note over UI, Storage: Secure Artifact Download
    UI->>API: GET /api/projects/{id}/artifacts/download/{filename}
    API->>DB: Check Project Ownership
    API->>Storage: Verify Path within Tenant Namespace
    Storage-->>API: Stream File Content
    API-->>UI: Streamed Binary / Zip
